  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The remainder, when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>103</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Using the binomial expansion in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>103</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>51</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>51</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>51</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>51</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>51</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>51</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>51</mn><mn>51</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>51</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>51</mn><mn>50</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>51</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>51</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>51</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>51</mn></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn></math>, so when above equation is divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>51</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;as remainder,</p><p>Now again using binomial in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>51</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>17</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>17</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>12</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>12</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now dividing above equation by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#247;</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>,</p><p>Now changing negative remainder to positive we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>,</p><p>Hence, when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>103</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>17</mn></math>&nbsp;gives&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;as remainder.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}